WEBVTT

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.290
But he never showed up.

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.540
Oh no, I'm late!
Really? That's horrible!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.170
After that, HOMRA responded
just the way I wanted them to.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:31.300
Not to mention bringing out the Blues too!

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:35.800
Seriously, the more clans there are,
the more fun the game becomes.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.300
So pretty...

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:41.470
HOMRA causing trouble
will indeed force SCEPTER 4

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:46.270
to dispatch more of their
personnel to quell the situation.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:50.570
So I guess getting HOMRA involved
wasn't such a bad idea.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:54.860
However, your decision to exploit
the deceased was quite unattractive.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.240
I don't care about your aesthetics, Yukari.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.080
Besides, I got to take a better look at the Red and Blue's Sword of Damocles.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:07.710
The crack on the Blue's Sword is bigger
than the last time I saw it.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:09.750
That's good to know.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.590
By the way, how was my dear Kuroh?

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:15.220
You mean, Yatogami Kuroh?

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:18.640
He didn't look as strong as
you make him out to be, Yukari.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.720
Is he really your kid brother?

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:23.100
He's not my real brother.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:28.690
Just that we spent some time together as pupils of our master, Miwa Ichigen.

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:30.610
Yukari! Senior pupil!

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:32.860
Enough small talk.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:36.610
Did you buy the detergent I asked you to get?

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.990
I wish you'd stop asking me to run your stupid errands.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:42.620
I'm busy too, you know.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:45.000
And yeah, I did get it!

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.500
Hey! I asked you for the one with softener!

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:53.550
Messed up! Messed up! Messed up!

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:55.920
Shut up, you damned bird!

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:58.510
Does it really matter?

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:03.220
Anyway, when do we get to try something new?

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:07.020
I'm getting kind of tired of just giving out missions to the low-rank members.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:11.810
You're right.
We're missing some spark.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:16.280
It's frustrating that the Silver King
continues to be missing.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:20.110
Is the Silver King really alive?

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.910
Then again, we are talking about a guy

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:25.040
who was hiding up in the sky for over 70 years...

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.660
So I guess running around is his specialty.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:32.290
However, he descended one year ago...

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.670
It was his second coming...

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:39.050
I want to meet the Silver King...

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:43.550
The first king to uncover the mystery of the Slates.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.970
This is the Eternal King we're talking about.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:51.900
As the Ever-changing King, you have almost zero chemistry with him, Nagare-chan.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:55.440
He could end up being our biggest obstacle.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:58.110
Save your breath.

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:01.450
Once he makes up his mind, he never listens.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:06.080
Well, do whatever you want, Nagare-chan.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:09.250
I just want to see if this new world you create

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:12.580
is a beautiful one or not.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:16.960
I'm up for any game that Nagare comes up with!

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:21.090
After all, we're your players, Nagare.
That's what we're here for.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:24.510
The Green Clan, JUNGLE!

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:59.980
Those are the clansmen of the Silver King
whom you're obsessed with, right?

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:01.980
Are you concerned?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:05.860
Yes, I am concerned about them.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:11.120
The Silver Clansmen are associating
with Blue King Munakata Reisi

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.870
and Red King Kushina Anna.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:19.500
This is definitely something to be concerned about.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:23.090
You think the Silver King is pulling the strings and

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:27.010
that's why these guys are in contact
with the Reds and the Blues?

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.600
A flower bud is pretty.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:34.140
But a bud that falls before it blooms...

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.810
is even more beautiful.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:42.400
Nip the bud! Nip the bud!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.450
That's the plan, right?

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.530
Iwa-san? Nagare-chan?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.910
What are you babbling about?

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:54.870
You're absolutely right.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:58.420
Whatever the possibilities,

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:01.920
once the bud is nipped,
it ends as just that... a possibility.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.960
Yukari, I have a mission.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:08.300
Please remove them from our game.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:16.560
Never thought I'd be able to pick up
from where we left off this soon.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.770
Perhaps this is fate too.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.310
Fate!

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.440
If we're gonna get rid of Yatogami Kuroh,

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.530
then I'm coming too.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:31.870
Yukari and I are split as to
whether he's strong or weak.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:34.580
Now we'll know in black and white.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:38.540
"Black and white"?
Is that a pun on Kuroh?

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.830
You're pretty funny for a kid, Sukuna.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:47.090
I really hate it when you say things like that.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:53.680
Well then,
shall we go nip the bud, Sukuna-chan?

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:54.850
Sure!

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:57.310
I forgot one thing, Yukari.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:01.730
It's okay to kill Yatogami Kuroh...

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:05.860
But bring Ameno Miyabi here alive.

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:10.360
Sure, but may I ask why?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:14.370
Because we are similar...

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.950
"Similar"...?

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:17.870
I see...

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.830
Understood, milord.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.380
Isn't it unlike you...

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:32.800
to rush into things like this?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.390
You are right, Iwa-san.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.310
I <i>am</i> in a rush.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:38.890
And also running out of patience.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.310
If the First King...

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.400
Adolf K. Weismann the Silver King

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:47.400
has any intention of continuing the game...

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.650
he wouldn't let his own subjects die.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.450
Will he run away again?

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:56.080
Or this time, will he stay?

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:59.660
We will finally know the answer.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:02.420
I can't wait to find out.

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:02.830
Move onward!

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:03.960
Time for battle!
Move onward!

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:04.790
Just a moment...

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:08.000
Shiro...
We're both doing fine, so don't worry...

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:13.380
Stop that! It's disrespectful!

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:17.300
But I want Shiro to eat too.

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:22.810
Fine, but eat your own meal first!

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:27.400
Thank you for the food!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.820
Know your place!
Thank you for the food!

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:33.820
Hmm... Not bad.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:36.070
By the way...

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:39.330
This room is getting pretty crowded with stuff.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.040
Yeah...

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:43.460
Every time we go out looking for Shiro...

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:47.460
we somehow end up bringing stuff
back that reminds us of him.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:52.130
Well, we are using this place as our base of operations while searching for Shiro.

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:57.720
Still... where could he be wandering around?

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.600
I dunno...

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:03.430
But maybe, he's not that far away.

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:06.520
What makes you think that?

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.230
I just do!

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:12.610
So it has nothing to do with reason...

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.990
I suppose that's what it means...

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.990
to have faith.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.410
Hey, sup...

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:29.750
I kicked out every damned one of
the Greens who snuck into Shizume.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:33.840
Man! Those guys are like cockroaches.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:37.340
It's impossible to get rid of them all,
even for you, Yata-chan.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.390
The fact that we can't tell them apart

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.310
is what makes the Greens so special.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.520
I know that!

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:48.440
I meant those who were causing trouble.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.400
By the way, what're you doing?

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.150
Kusanagi-san, that's...!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.820
Like they say, "If you know your
enemy and you know yourself,

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:02.370
you need not fear the result of a hundred battles."

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:05.830
I was curious about how JUNGLE operates...

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:09.420
So I decided to do some spying using a disposable PDA.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:13.050
And look what popped up.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:15.800
What the hell? That's me!

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:20.340
It means the Greens put a bounty on your head.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:24.810
If they get you, they earn bonus points.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:29.400
And by increasing their points,
they move up the ranks in the clan.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.480
That's how it works.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.070
I see...

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.190
So they get rewarded, huh?

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:41.780
I guess it just shows how scared
they are of Yatagarasu-sama here.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:44.830
What? Are you kidding me?!

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.710
How come the Monkey's worth more than me?!

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:54.340
Well, you're about even in fighting,
but Fushimi can process information.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:58.340
Maybe the Greens figure that's more of a threat?

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:03.010
Hey, Anna. Where you going?

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:06.720
Neko forgot something when she came by yesterday.

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:11.600
She forgot something? What a scatterbrain.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.150
I have to take it to her.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.530
She probably needs it.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.240
Lemme have it!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.990
I'll take it to her.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:23.740
But...

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:28.250
A king shouldn't be going out alone running errands.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.910
Misaki...

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:34.130
You're the Red King now, but you're not Mikoto-san.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:35.630
Remember what I said?

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:39.260
Let me be someone you can rely on.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.300
Thank you.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:47.350
Then can you go to the school island
and return this to her?

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:53.900
Hey, Yata-chan, are you sure
about walking around with that?

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.150
You'll get arrested.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.150
That bitch?!

00:11:57.150 --> 00:12:01.530
How the hell does anyone
forget something like this?!

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.530
Wait, you mean she's not wearing any panties?!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.410
Oh, sorry about that!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.620
It's okay!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:17.630
Huh? Why not?!

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.760
I want to fight him too!

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.590
I already explained.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:24.640
Kuroh-chan was my junior when we were pupils.

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:29.600
Killing him is my duty... my destiny.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.680
I'll show no mercy to anyone who interferes,

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:35.150
not even you, Sukuna-chan.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:39.400
If you want the points,
I'll give them to you after I'm done.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:44.280
So don't get in my way, okay?

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:48.200
Where's the fun in getting points for free?

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.370
That's not how games work.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.080
All right, Yukari.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.090
I'll let you have that one.

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:01.840
And you?

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:04.220
Something urgent just came up.

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.760
So take care of Yatogami Kuroh, will you?

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.600
See you later!

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:14.100
I must say... Kids have such short attention spans.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.940
Thank you for your hard work, J-Rank-san.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:16.810
<i>You've earned 5 JUNGLE points.</i>

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.690
Okay, okay. Good work!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:20.070
Thanks.

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:25.900
Hey!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:28.620
Damn it...

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:31.660
Where the hell is Neko?

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:34.790
If I'm caught red-handed with this thing...

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:37.250
I'll kill myself out of shame.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:49.760
Monkey...

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:54.520
Misaki...

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:58.900
What's HOMRA doing in a place like this?

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.520
Trying to occupy this place again?

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:04.990
That's none of your damned business!

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:11.080
I still haven't thanked you yet, did I?

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:17.500
I'm talking about the time when
the Green Clan kidnapped Anna,

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.380
before she could awaken as a King.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.420
If you hadn't tipped us off,

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:30.180
I wouldn't have rescued her,
let alone found her.

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:32.300
And?

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:33.560
Huh?

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:37.560
Listen... I don't like you...

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.020
and it's not like I've forgiven you, but...

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:43.520
but I'm grateful for that one time.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:45.440
Thanks— Whoa?!

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.280
Hey!

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.160
What the hell, man?!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.200
Darn, there goes my back-attack chance.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:56.450
Huh?

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.160
Who the hell are you?!

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:04.550
If you're going to ramble on,

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:07.130
at least pay attention to your surroundings...

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:10.340
You're JUNGLE's top rank player...

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.340
Gojo Sukuna, right?

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:15.850
Oh, so you know who I am?

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:21.810
No wonder you're worth more points
than beany cap over there.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.650
Say that again, you brat!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.770
Bringing down the two of you
is worth 7,000 points.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.110
That's what I call a sweet mission.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:30.740
So do me a favor guys...

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:33.450
Turn into my points!

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.910
Kuroh-kun, I've been looking for you!

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.710
Kukuri. What is it?

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.130
Well...

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.630
It's not me actually.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:51.050
I brought someone who wants to talk to you.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:54.300
Hey, come on out!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.430
What are you doing? Hurry!

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:59.060
Come over here!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.020
Come on...

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.150
Don't be shy...

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:04.100
Tell him!

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:07.860
Umm... Yatogami Kuroh-san...

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:10.110
Please accept this!

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.070
For me?

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.410
E-Excuse me!

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:21.290
<i>You've earned 10 JUNGLE points.</i>

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.870
<i>Mission complete</i>

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:26.040
I wonder what it says inside?

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.540
Let's open it!

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:29.760
Sure...

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:36.260
So that girl's name is Yukari-chan?

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:37.890
Wow, she has such beautiful handwriting!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:40.930
I wonder if she comes from a good family?

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.270
<i>So you finally made your move...</i>

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.650
<i>Mishakuji Yukari.</i>

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:53.400
Go for it. I'm rooting for you.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:54.530
Thanks.

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:56.660
Wish me luck... Kukuri.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:57.530
Will do!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.430
It's been awhile, hasn't it?

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:22.680
I'm so glad to see you again... Kuroh-chan.

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:25.020
Mishakuji Yukari.

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.690
What do you want?!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:31.190
I thought I told you to call me "Onii-sama."

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.990
Furthermore, it's not attractive to ask questions

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:38.490
you already know the answer to.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.870
So you're here to settle things?

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:50.590
Wasting my time to give you an obvious answer...

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.880
is also unattractive!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:05.930
As I suspected, you are still lacking in skill.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:09.690
However, I commend you for not running away.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:17.240
This school island is the place
where my king, Shiro, calls home!

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:21.490
I will never let your kind set foot into this place!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.700
Well, that's too bad.

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:27.080
Because my comrade went inside just now.

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.590
Don't bully Kuroh!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.140
Neko!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:46.850
Don't worry.

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:52.190
My king has requested that you be brought
back to his presence unharmed, Neko-chan.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.360
Or should I say, Ameno Miyabi-chan.

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.940
"Ameno"...?

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:58.610
Who's that?

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.700
You don't remember?

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.620
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.950
Mishakuji Yukari!

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:07.040
Don't you dare lay a hand on my friend!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:17.670
You're as upright as ever, Kuroh-chan.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.800
Upright to the point of beauty...

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.930
However, even that has a limit.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.600
Stop talking nonsense!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:37.820
For example, the ones who let Sukuna-chan inside school grounds

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.650
were the students themselves.

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:45.240
They know nothing about your thoughts,
or anger or sense of purpose.

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:47.910
And knowing nothing, they welcomed the Greens.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:53.540
This place you are so intent on
protecting already belongs to us!

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:05.970
JUNGLE can set down its roots anywhere,

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.930
and suck out nourishment from anywhere.

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:13.690
The giant tree of Green will spread
its branches across the stars,

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:18.690
and eventually engulf the golden sun
and the silvery moon.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:24.490
Then this world will be enveloped
in beautiful green and be born anew.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.620
I want to witness that.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:33.580
But you will not see it happen.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:37.540
You will remain a bud... and die here.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:41.420
I will never yield to you people!

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:44.180
Shiro... Shiro...

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:47.390
At this rate... Kuroh will be killed...

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:58.020
I see... So you're prepared to die.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:00.980
That look on your face right now is beautiful...

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:02.740
Yatogami Kuroh...

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.280
Your life is mine!

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:06.240
Shiro!

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:09.030
Please save us!

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:11.620
Shiro!

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:39.230
Y-You're...?!

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:43.490
Shiro!

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:44.900
Shiro...

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:48.110
You come invading a person's home...

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:51.870
And worse, you try to hurt his family...

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:54.120
I'd call that the height of arrogance...

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.830
Green King...

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:57.750
Hisui Nagare!

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:04.050
Finally... At long last, you're finally here...

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:06.090
You have finally returned...

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:08.890
The First King... the Silver King...

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:11.390
Adolf K. Weismann.

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:13.930
You've returned to this world...

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:18.480
To join our game again...

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:26.990
I welcome you back...

00:23:57.660 --> 00:24:02.960
The man who started it all has finally returned...

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:04.750
With newfound resolve,

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:06.880
the Silver King takes a stand against the Green King...

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:12.590
His plan: To form an alliance with
the Red and Blue Kings.

00:24:13.050 --> 00:24:17.060
The three kings come together
and begin their conference.

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:20.180
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings,</i>

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:23.190
#4 "Knot".

00:24:23.190 --> 00:24:26.270
Is this the beginning, or...?
